<title>GREECE: Drachma falls vs dollar, rises vs mark at fix.</title>
<headline>Drachma falls vs dollar, rises vs mark at fix.</headline>
<text>
<p>1040 GMT: The drachma retreated against the dollar and rose against the mark at the Bank of Greece's daily fix, Commercial Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>** Dollar set at 270.980 drachmas from Monday's 270.500</p>
<p>** Mark set at 159.595 drachmas from previous 159.930 fix</p>
<p>** Spot dollar quoted around 271.12/22 against the drachma and spot mark at 159.60/70 drachmas.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
